  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.01 Applicability. Part 204 applies to:\n\n(a) Proceedings conducted pursuant to RSA 365 other than rulemakings;\n\n(b) Proceedings conducted pursuant to RSA 369;\n\n(c) Proceedings to acquire property or rights pursuant to RSA 371;\n\n(d) Proceedings conducted pursuant to RSA 374:3-a, RSA 374:7, RSA 374:22 -:36, RSA 374:34-a; RSA 374:7, RSA 374:37-40, RSA 374:41-47, and RSA 374:47-a.\n\n(e) Proceedings related to the implementation or enforcement of RSA 374-F, and RSA 374-G;\n\n(f) Rate proceedings conducted pursuant to RSA 378 when the commission exercises its rights to suspend a proposed rate schedule pursuant to RSA 378:6;\n\n(g) Commission reviews of integrated distribution plans pursuant to RSA 378:40;\n\n(h) Any other proceeding in which a person is entitled to notice and hearing;\n\n(i) Any other docket when the commission determines it would be just and reasonable and in the public interest to conduct the case as an adjudicative proceeding per RSA 541-A;\n\n(j) Proceedings conducted pursuant to RSA 362-A;\n\n(k) Proceedings conducted pursuant to RSA 362-I:2;\n\n(l) Proceedings upon the commission’s own motion pursuant to RSA 366:7; and\n\n(m) Proceedings initiated by the department related to affiliate contracts pursuant to RSA 366:9.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
}
